- Draft a full message/email to Dr. Lee requesting her assessment and possible referral to Colorado Cardiology?
- Turn this into a one‑page checklist you can print and bring to the appointment?

Also: you mentioned a “last peak flow 110” — is that peak expiratory flow (L/min)? If you’re concerned about lung function or asthma/COPD, tell me more and I’ll include relevant pulmonary questions for the visit.

