- Fall history / mobility status (relevant to anticoagulation discussion given osteopenia/back pain)

Suggested questions to ask Dr. Lee at the physical
1. Diagnosis and monitoring
   - “Do I have — or am I at high risk for — atrial fibrillation based on my history and any ECGs?”
   - “Should I have an ECG or ambulatory monitor (Holter/event monitor) to screen for intermittent AF given my symptoms/risk?”

